# Valkyrie's Call: "nontoken" (CR 111.7, 700.4). Resolute Reinforcements makes a 1/1 Soldier token and is itself a nontoken 1/1
# creature. On turn 3 Bot1 Bolts the Soldier token: it dies and nothing returns (a token that has left the battlefield is gone,
# CR 111.7). On turn 5 the second Bolt kills Resolute Reinforcements itself and that nontoken creature returns as a 2/2 flying
# Angel with a +1/+1 counter, a positive control that the Call works in the same game
# (it enters again, so its own trigger makes a new Soldier token).

